{
 "_notes": "Pogo Pandemonium = levels 10-13 (stage models 675, 671, 667, 663; alt/backdrop twins 673/669/665/661). Hole (8x8 tiles of 0.5 model units) is centred at the origin, scale 3.6 => tile 1.8. Tile-template quads and in-hole props are omitted via parts. The animated board uses textures and seat palettes from 0674, 0670, 0666 and 0662. Pogo-a-gogo draws its rim from model 0671. EFFECTS (played by realFx from pack 0770's effect scripts, see re/notes/pogoPainter.md): tpBoom* = script 0 (projectile end / stun entry), tpPuff*/tpStar = script 1 (pickup), tpStunPuff = script 2 (every 4 frames while stunned), tpShard* = script 3 (the '!' crate breaks), tpDust* = script 4 (touchdown), tpBeam0-7 = beam segment frames (object 0x1405), tpBeamEnd/Spark = script 8; tpMine* = El Pogo Loco's mine blast (level model 0667 script 1). Cash-in number = HUD pack 0732 digits (object 0x1409).",
